  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Regulatory Reform Pillar of the ASEAN Economic Integration Programme - Implementation Phase (ODA)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is for the implementation phase of Regulatory Reform pillar of EIP programme. This project aims to improve regulatory and standards system in ASEAN Member States that are less bureaucratic, provide a more stable environment for business investment, and better protect workers and consumers, particularly the most vulnerable in society. This code is for the ODA part of the programme.</narrative>
  </description>
